# Vision Velocity - environment index (NO SECRETS IN THIS FILE).
# Each app has its own detailed template with comments:
#   backend/.env.example
#   frontend/.env.example
# Values are entered in Vercel (Project > Settings > Environment Variables),
# never committed. Variable names by project and environment:
#
# BACKEND project (vision-velocity-backend)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   (public by design)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   (SECRET, server only)
#   JWT_SECRET                  (SECRET; use a different value per environment)
#   RESEND_API_KEY              (SECRET), EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAIL_FROM, NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAIL_REPLY_TO, ADMIN_NOTIFICATION_EMAILS
#   CLIENT_APP_URL              production: https://visionvelocity.com.au
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL         production: https://visionvelocity.com.au
#   TRACKING_BASE_URL           production: https://api.visionvelocity.com.au
#   RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS, RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS, ENABLE_EMAIL_LOGGING
#
# FRONTEND project (vision-velocity-frontend)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL    production: https://api.visionvelocity.com.au
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
